<h2 style="text-align:justify"><font face="Arial" size="2"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
10.0pt">BUSINESS</span></font></h2>
<p class="MsoBodyText"><b>ANY PERSON WANTING TO VISIT THE COUNTRY OF SAN MARINO, 
  HAS TO APPLY FOR A VISA TO ITALY. AND AFTER REACHING ITALY, ONE CAN PROCEED 
  TOWARDS SAN MARINO. THE VISA HAS TO BE APPLIED AT: <br>
  </b></p>
<p class="MsoBodyText" align="center"><b>THE EMBASSY OF ITALY 50-E, <br>
  CHANDRAGUPTA MARG, <br>
  CHANAKYAPURI, <br>
  NEW DELHI - 110021. <br>
  PHONE: 91-11-26114353/26114355/26114359 </b> <br>
  <b>...........................................................................................................................................................................................</b></p>
<p class="MsoBodyText" align="left">· PASSPORT SHOULD BE VALID FOR ATLEAST 3 MONTHS 
  FROM THE EXPIRY OF THE VISA.<br>
  · VISA APPLICATION FORM DULY FILLED IN AND SIGNED.<br>
  · 1 RECENT PASSPORT SIZE COLOUR PHOTOGRAPH WITH A WHITE BACKGROUND.<br>
  · COVERING LETTER FROM THE INDIAN COMPANY STATING THE APPLICANT'S NAME, DESIGNATION, 
  PURPOSE AND DURATION OF VISIT ALONG WITH THE DETAILS OF ACTIVITIES AND BUSINESS 
  WITH THE CONCERNED ITALIAN COMPANY.<br>
  · REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE, MEMORANDUM AND ARTICLES OF ASSOCIATION OF THE INDIAN 
  COMPANY.<br>
  · INVITATION LETTER SIGNED DULY BY THE AUTHORISED SIGNATORY OF THE ITALIAN COMPANY 
  SHOULD BE FAXED DIRECTLY TO THE EMBASSY. THE FAX LETTER SHOULD BE ACCOMPANIED 
  BY THE REGISTRATION CERTIFICATE OF THE ITALIAN COMPANY WITH THE <b>"CHAMBER 
  OF COMMERCE" - SAN MARINO</b>.<br>
  · PERSONAL AND COMPANY BANK ACCOUNT STATEMENTS FOR THE LAST 3 MONTHS.<br>
  · PERSONAL AND COMPANY INCOME TAX CHALLANS FOR THE LAST 3 YEARS.<br>
  · SALARY SLIPS FOR THE LAST 3 MONTHS, IN ORIGINAL AND PHOTOCOPY.<br>
  · FOREIGN EXCHANGE ENDORSEMENT ON PASSPORT / CREDIT CARD COPIES.<br>
  · HOTEL RESERVATION OR PROOF OF ACCOMODATION.<br>
  · CONFIRMED AIR TICKET · IN CASE OF PARTICIPATION IN FAIRS, EVIDENCE OF THE 
  FULL PAYMENT OF THE STALL. <br>
  <b> MEDICAL REQUIREMENT:</b> OVERSEAS MEDICAL INSURANCE OF MINIMUM EURO 30, 
  000 /- <br>
  <b> FEE:</b> RS.1, 750 /- FOR VISA PROCESSING FEE RS. 441 /- FOR VFS CHARGES. 
  ALL FEES PAYABLE BY DEMAND DRAFT DRAWN IN FAVOUR OF <b>"THE EMBASSY OF ITALY" 
  - NEW DELHI.</b><br>
  <b> TIME TAKEN:</b> 2 WORKING DAYS <br>
  <b> NOTE:</b> · THERE WILL BE NO COLLECTION ON WEDNESDAYS.<br>
  · PASSPORTS ISSUED IN SOUTH INDIAN REGION CANNOT BE APPLIED IN NEW DELHI.<br>
  · PERSONAL PRESENCE OF APPLICANT IS MANDATORY IF THE APPLICANT DOES NOT HAVE 
  A VALID U.K. / U.S.A. VISA.<br>
  · ALL DOCUMENTS HAS TO BE SUBMITTED IN ORIGINALS AND A PHOTOCOPY OF EACH. </p>
